@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
# Cole aqui os tokens retornados pelo login/cadastro
@adminToken = COLE_O_TOKEN_DO_ADMIN
@userToken = COLE_O_TOKEN_DO_USUARIO
@abrigoId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@petId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Ponto de entrada (HATEOAS)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api

### Login Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@petadoption.com", "senha": "Admin@123" }

### Cadastro de usuário comum (perfil User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Usuário Demo", "email": "demo@email.com", "senha": "Senha@123" }

### Sem token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pets

### Pets paginados (PageResult + HATEOAS)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pets?page=1&pageSize=3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Pets filtrados
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pets?especie=Gato&status=Disponivel
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Serviço externo: ViaCEP
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cep/01310-100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### CEP inexistente -> 404 (Cep.NaoEncontrado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cep/99999999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Criar abrigo (endereço preenchido pelo ViaCEP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/abrigos
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Abrigo Demo", "telefone": "11912345678", "cep": "01310-100", "numero": "1000" }

### Abrigo duplicado -> 409 (exceção lançada no Repository)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/abrigos
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Abrigo Demo", "telefone": "11912345678", "cep": "01310-100" }

### Usuário comum criando abrigo -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/abrigos
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Abrigo Proibido", "telefone": "11912345678", "cep": "01310-100" }

### Abrigos paginados
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/abrigos?page=1&pageSize=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Pets do abrigo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/abrigos/{{abrigoId}}/pets
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Criar pet
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pets
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Caramelo", "especie": "Cachorro", "raca": "Vira-lata", "idadeMeses": 18, "abrigoId": "{{abrigoId}}" }

### Adotar pet (usuário comum)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/{{petId}}/adocao
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Adotar novamente -> 422 (Pet.JaAdotado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/{{petId}}/adocao
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Pet inexistente -> 404 (erro RETORNADO pelo Repository / origin OperationResult)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Remover pet inexistente -> 404 (erro LANÇADO pelo Repository / origin Exception)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Remover abrigo com pets -> 409
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/abrigos/{{abrigoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
